<div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px">
<section class='card '><h2>STOP REPORT</h2><div class='row'><span class='k'>verdict</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>escalated</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>failed children</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>exit codes</span><span class='v'>—</span></div></section>
<section class='card '><h2>RUN REPORT</h2><div class='row'><span class='k'>final state</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>stop reason</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>duration</span><span class='v'>—</span></div></section>
<section class='card '><h2>PLAN</h2><div class='row'><span class='k'>duration hours</span><span class='v'>0.35</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>retention</span><span class='v'>raw_hot_hours=2.0, sealed_grace_seconds=1800, delete_when_free_below=0, deletion_enabled=False, preservation=raw is deleted only after M-03 and M-07 are shown to survive compaction at the preregistered resolution</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>collector resume</span><span class='v'>no</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>no live path</span><span class='v'>children are read-only market data plus the PAPER broker; no child holds execution credentials</span></div></section>
<section class='card '><h2>CONTROLS</h2><div class='row'><span class='k'>read only</span><span class='v'>yes</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>mutating endpoints</span><span class='v'>—</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>start</span><span class='v'>python scripts/start_paper_lab.py --run-id &lt;id&gt;</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>status</span><span class='v'>python scripts/paper_lab_status.py</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>stop</span><span class='v'>python scripts/start_paper_lab.py --stop reports/paper-lab/&lt;id&gt;</span></div><div class='row'><span class='k'>restart</span><span class='v'>python scripts/start_paper_lab.py --restart --run-id &lt;id&gt;</span></div></section>
</div>
<footer>No LIVE control is presented because no LIVE path exists: every plane is PAPER or read-only market data.
Controls are commands, not endpoints — <code>the dashboard is an observability surface: a stop it could trigger is a stop a bug could trigger, and the lab must have exactly one operator path</code></footer>
<script>
async function refreshSignals() {
  const target = document.getElementById('signals');
  if (!target) return;
  // The section is rendered by the server, so the browser and a refresh can
  // never disagree about how a row is formatted.
  try {
    const response = await fetch('/signals' + window.location.search, {cache: 'no-store'});
    if (response.ok) target.outerHTML = await response.text();
  } catch (error) { /* keep the last good table */ }
}
async function refresh() {
  await refreshSignals();
  setTimeout(refresh, 15000);
}
setTimeout(refresh, 15000);
</script>
</body></html>
